    "With Draw and Hold, pause the Pencil at the end of a stroke and it snaps to the line, circle, rectangle or other shape you drew. Undo brings your own stroke back.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With Draw and Hold, pause the Pencil at the end of a stroke and it snaps to the line, circle, rectangle or other shape you drew. Undo brings your own stroke back."
          }
        }
      }
